re and training process. The terminology is precise and consistently used throughout the paper. The algorithmic presentation is thorough, with well-defined variables and steps that are easy to follow. The experiments section is comprehensive, providing both quantitative and qualitative results that support the claims made in the paper. The conclusion summarizes the contributions and limitations of the method, offering a clear perspective on future work.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. The paper clearly defines the key functions and variables, such as the signed distance function (SDF) and the color function, and explains their roles in the reconstruction process. The equations are numbered and referenced appropriately, making it easy for the reader to follow the derivations. The notation for the weight function and its properties is clearly explained, and the intuition behind the design is well-articulated. The training process is described with clear mathematical formulations, including the loss functions and regularization terms. Overall, the mathematical presentation is clear and accessible to an expert reader.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-005","SRC-006","SRC-019","SRC-021","SRC-026","SRC-028","SRC-031","SRC-032","SRC-033"],"review_text":"The figures and tables are appropriately referenced and described in the text. The captions provide sufficient context to understand the content of each figure and table. For example, Figure 1 illustrates the difference between surface rendering and volume rendering, and the caption clearly explains the example shown. Table 1 presents the quantitative evaluation on the DTU dataset, and the caption specifies the conditions under which the results were obtained. The figures are used effectively to support the claims made in the paper, and the textual descriptions provide the necessary details to interpret the visual information. The use of figures and tables enhances the clarity of the paper and aids the reader in understanding the results.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"04e240d8bbee095db293d6af940c461bc3ecf695157438c46ca9f7ba6a397dda","paper_id":"D7bPRxNt_AP","paper_ordinal":111,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"1475db658d813097fc4dcbd4119a884c332d3e2d5e4312fbb971bcd4139de12f","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"D7bPRxNt_AP","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"a462a265326714c353a7752ca841d6e97d84de8943fc84b2894c13256a8fcd7f","request_identity_sha256":"a10c6843347101b65b90c4e7305406bf45543fe60dfd7084b8b1fc1cf0b23b8b","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v5","usage":{"completion_tokens":1138,"prompt_tokens":18990,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":20128},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"a10c6843347101b65b90c4e7305406bf45543fe60dfd7084b8b1fc1cf0b23b8b","role":"CLAR","role_ordinal":1,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v4"}